git commit -m "Setup wizard Scope: expand each uploaded file into its full FBDI object set. A file detected as Supplier now previews all 6 FBDI conversions (Import - Address - Site - Site Assignment - Contacts - Banks) via the object-types catalog, highlighted and selected by default with per-step toggles to change. On finish, file-mode uses generate-set (one dataset - full object set) and drops any deselected steps; unknown types fall back to a single conversion."
echo Pushing...
git push origin main
echo.
echo ====== DONE - Press any key to close ======
pause
